Reproducibility: notes/n1.txt through notes/n10.txt contain the full notes; result_notes.json records the deliverable and support edges. Run python checks/verify_formulas.py for the lightweight symbolic evidence, and python checks/audit_deliverable.py for schema/support-DAG checks. The audit passed with 10 notes, 24 support edges and matching note artifacts; it verifies structure only. Primary browser rerun inputs and connector outputs are in sources/requests.json and sources/*.json. The unchanged task is retained in task_input.json. Direct local PDF downloads were denied; connector retrieval provided primary text. Environment details are in checks/environment.json and checks/formulas_output.json. No supervised compute service was exposed, and no resource-heavy local calculation was launched. These are unverified proof drafts: source retrieval and script execution do not certify mathematical correctness.

